===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|бꙑ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*by}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-бы.ogg}}

===Particle===
{{head|ru|particle|head=бы}}

# {{non-gloss|A verbal particle used to render [[conditional]] and [[subjunctive]] mood}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[говорить|говори́л(а)]].|I spoke.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] '''бы''' [[говорить|говори́л(a)]].|I would (should) have spoken.; I would speak.; I might speak.}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year= {{circa| 1827 - 1828}}|year_published= 1837|author= w:Alexander Pushkin|title= w:ru:Арап Петра Великого|trans-title= {{w|The Moor of Peter the Great}}|chapter= 4
|text= — Сказа́л '''бы''' слове́чко, да волк недале́чко, — сказа́л, нахму́рясь, Гаври́ла Афана́сьевич.|translation= “I’'''d''' add a word or two of my own, but even the walls have ears,” said Gavrila Afanasevich, frowning.}}

====Usage notes====
* The particle '''бы''' is often shortened to {{l|ru|б}}.
* The particle '''бы''' may appear in any place within a sentence except the beginning. In colloquial speech it can be heard used multiple times within the same clause, but this usage is considered erroneous.
* The particle '''бы''' is, in some expressions, omitted in colloquial settings. For example:
:* [[словно бы]] → [[словно]] (бы)

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|е́сли бы то́лько}}
* {{l|ru|ка́к бы не}}
* {{l|ru|сло́вно бы}}
* {{l|ru|что́бы}}
* {{l|ru|я́кобы}}

